==== Wave 2: Modlist

Wave 2 is the richest layer: the deepest mechanics, the most content, the fullest expression of the modlist philosophy. The rule from Wave 1 holds and sharpens — new systems and new decisions yes, pure power spikes never. At this wave, mods must also *compose*: a Wave 2 mechanic should interact with Wave 1's systems and Wave 0's base rather than stand apart.

As of 2026-08-12 the maintained No Man's Sky modding scene is thin at this depth: fleet, settlement, and endgame-system mods are almost all abandoned (last updated before the 2025 modding rework) or pure power spikes, so most cards below remain *"user to provide"* rather than being padded with incompatible or unearned mods. The evaluated and rejected candidates are recorded in STATUS.md. The cards that are filled were verified on Nexus on 2026-08-12 and carry their last-updated dates for the compatibility heuristic.

